# A frame of 200 ms on the guest, then on the host, while the guest carries a box.
scenario edge_stall
scene two_chars_item
seed 31
guests 1
settle 5s

net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 10ms loss 1%

p1 walk box
p1 grab box as grab
p1 walk 2 2
p1 walk -1 2
p1 drop as put
p0 walk -2 -2
at 1500ms stall g1 for 200ms
at 2500ms stall host for 200ms

expect result grab granted
expect result put done
expect agree_at_rest 5cm 5deg
expect no_stuck
